We're just taking our— We're just hedging our bets,

00:37:51.520 --> 00:37:53.480
we're just going for the best option here...

00:37:53.480 --> 00:37:55.400
and that seems like the most, m...

00:37:55.400 --> 00:37:57.400
positive outcome, alternative that we could possibly d—

00:37:57.400 --> 00:37:58.440
BOOM!

00:37:58.860 --> 00:38:01.720
Thankfully, I got out of that awkward conversation... by...

00:38:01.720 --> 00:38:04.200
killing *giggling* the other person in the conversation.

00:38:04.480 --> 00:38:04.980
There we go—

00:38:04.980 --> 00:38:05.920
"Hah! Take some of that!"

00:38:06.460 --> 00:38:07.600
"Woohoo!"

00:38:07.600 --> 00:38:08.300
"Oooh, shiny!"

00:38:08.600 --> 00:38:09.160
Alright.

00:38:09.820 --> 00:38:10.700
"Now's our chance!"

00:38:10.700 --> 00:38:11.240
"Let's go!"

00:38:11.240 --> 00:38:12.480
Now that he's a pile of dust,

00:38:12.480 --> 00:38:13.740
and extremely dead,

00:38:13.740 --> 00:38:14.760
we can get outta here!

00:38:15.400 --> 00:38:16.380
hawoosh~

00:38:16.380 --> 00:38:17.300
Okay, well...

00:38:17.720 --> 00:38:18.700
"Achievement unlocked!"

00:38:18.700 --> 00:38:19.240
"Arrival..."

00:38:19.660 --> 00:38:20.520
*quietly* One star?

00:38:21.360 --> 00:38:22.040
*still quietly* Nice!

00:38:22.040 --> 00:38:22.700
*alarm beeping*

00:38:22.700 --> 00:38:23.200
Uh oh...
*alarm beeping*

00:38:23.200 --> 00:38:25.380
*alarm beeping*

00:38:26.920 --> 00:38:27.420
Oh...

00:38:27.820 --> 00:38:28.640
I'm alive!

00:38:29.600 --> 00:38:30.720
H-I'm alive!

00:38:31.540 --> 00:38:32.260
Alrighty then...

00:38:32.940 --> 00:38:33.800
...Am I alive?

00:38:34.100 --> 00:38:35.060
"YAWN"

00:38:35.920 --> 00:38:37.600
"That was [a] really weird dream."

00:38:37.600 --> 00:38:38.720
"I wish I could remember it..."

00:38:41.120 --> 00:38:41.620
*sighs*

00:38:41.620 --> 00:38:43.260
"I've gotta get ready, or I'll be late for school."

00:38:43.860 --> 00:38:44.360
Okay...

00:38:44.660 --> 00:38:45.740
"I can get back to watching videos"

00:38:45.740 --> 00:38:46.600
"once I'm done with school."

00:38:47.000 --> 00:38:48.340
"I really need to rearrange these notes"

00:38:48.340 --> 00:38:49.500
"once I get back from school."

00:38:50.080 --> 00:38:50.720
"I'm ready to go!"

00:38:51.020 --> 00:38:51.960
Oh... kay?

00:38:51.960 --> 00:38:53.800
How are you jumping out of bed and ready to go?

00:38:54.020 --> 00:38:55.360
"I'll have time to write in my journal later."

00:38:55.540 --> 00:38:56.760
Who's a good doggy?

00:38:56.760 --> 00:38:58.020
"Hello Steve! Who's a good boy!"

00:38:58.260 --> 00:38:59.220
uh bow woof

00:38:59.420 --> 00:39:00.640
woof bow

00:39:00.940 --> 00:39:04.140
bow a pet named Steve, that's funny, bow wow woof

00:39:04.140 --> 00:39:05.780
Get outta my way, I gotta look at myself.

00:39:05.780 --> 00:39:07.000
Lookin' good~

00:39:07.420 --> 00:39:08.980
Tuump, you ain't never—

00:39:08.980 --> 00:39:09.780
TUUUUMP

00:39:09.780 --> 00:39:11.580
You ain't never looked so good.

00:39:11.880 --> 00:39:13.620
I'm real proud of you TUUUMP

00:39:14.200 --> 00:39:15.620
Man, don't you just—

00:39:15.620 --> 00:39:16.780
"Ready to start the day?"

00:39:16.780 --> 00:39:19.260
You... know it... bitch...

00:39:19.260 --> 00:39:19.840
Yes!

00:39:20.200 --> 00:39:21.340
"Let's go!"

00:39:21.340 --> 00:39:21.960
Alright.

00:39:21.960 --> 00:39:23.920
You... know it...

00:39:23.920 --> 00:39:24.640
betch...

00:39:25.280 --> 00:39:25.960
"Later that night—"

00:39:25.960 --> 00:39:27.140
Okay, alright then.

00:39:27.820 --> 00:39:29.720
"I couldn't focus in any of my classes today."

00:39:29.720 --> 00:39:31.460
"I guess I'm still shaken up from last night's dream—"

00:39:31.460 --> 00:39:33.540
Well, you were... so peppy this morning!

00:39:34.040 --> 00:39:35.060
And why you go to school,

00:39:35.060 --> 00:39:36.220
like, the moment you wake up,

00:39:36.220 --> 00:39:38.600
'til the moment you get to bed is... just...

00:39:38.600 --> 00:39:39.880
a buncha—WHOA

00:39:40.400 --> 00:39:41.440
a bunch of school...

00:39:41.440 --> 00:39:42.440
"I really love Mondays."

00:39:42.440 --> 00:39:43.280
"I know that's kinda weird to say,"

00:39:43.280 --> 00:39:44.540
"but it's always like a new start."

00:39:44.540 --> 00:39:45.540
"I had German today, and that's like"

00:39:45.540 --> 00:39:46.840
"my favorite class right now."

00:39:46.840 --> 00:39:49.900
"And Mondays are when Markiplier posts RY... C."

00:39:49.900 --> 00:39:51.620
"Well, he's... *cough* supposed to."

00:39:51.620 --> 00:39:52.460
"So yeah, Mondays are..."

00:39:52.460 --> 00:39:52.960
*clears throat*

00:39:52.960 --> 00:39:53.640
*inhales*

00:39:53.640 --> 00:39:54.440
*slurs* "usually th-besh deys—"

00:39:54.440 --> 00:39:55.080
*inaudible*

00:39:55.080 --> 00:39:56.580
"But for some reason, today was different."

00:39:56.580 --> 00:39:58.400
"I couldn't focus, and I didn't get anything done."

00:39:58.400 --> 00:40:00.820
"I kept dream— uh, thinking about that dream... I had."

00:40:00.820 --> 00:40:02.360
"It was so weird and a ton of stuff happened,"

00:40:02.360 --> 00:40:03.800
"but I can't remember any of it."

00:40:03.800 --> 00:40:05.920
"Usually, that's how dreams go, but like..."

00:40:05.920 --> 00:40:07.180
"I can't shake the feeling that there's something"

00:40:07.180 --> 00:40:09.080
"I should be... remembering..."

00:40:09.640 --> 00:40:12.180
"I know is... is that is what it was—"

00:40:12.180 --> 00:40:14.220
"really dark at one point, then there was a burst of light"

00:40:14.220 --> 00:40:15.100
"and that's it."

00:40:15.100 --> 00:40:16.680
"Pissed me off that I will probably never remember,"

00:40:16.680 --> 00:40:17.560
"but whatever."

00:40:17.560 --> 00:40:18.580
Okay!

00:40:18.580 --> 00:40:20.540
"Anyway, gotta see Connor tomorrow."

00:40:20.540 --> 00:40:22.360
"He's visiting the states for two months this time."

00:40:22.360 --> 00:40:23.860
"It'll be really cool to have him around,"

00:40:23.860 --> 00:40:25.360
"after he moved to the UK."

00:40:25.360 --> 00:40:27.160
"A bunch of us went after school for ice cream today, th—"

00:40:27.160 --> 00:40:28.060
"so that was fun."

00:40:28.060 --> 00:40:29.180
"At least my Monday ended well,"

00:40:29.180 --> 00:40:31.180
"even though it was still distracted by that dream."

00:40:31.180 --> 00:40:32.380
"Well, I guess that's all for my Monday."

00:40:32.380 --> 00:40:34.040
"It's almost 11pm, so I should get going to"

00:40:34.040 --> 00:40:34.980
BEH-EH-EH-EHD

00:40:35.200 --> 00:40:36.100
Alright, well...

00:40:36.340 --> 00:40:37.280
Uh, Steve!

00:40:37.280 --> 00:40:38.600
"Goodnight, Steve! My good pup!"

00:40:38.600 --> 00:40:39.740
Woof, bow

00:40:39.740 --> 00:40:40.520
Bow, woof

00:40:41.020 --> 00:40:42.360
Woof, wah-vow

00:40:42.360 --> 00:40:44.500
"Aw, I forgot to sort these out... do it tomorrow"

00:40:44.500 --> 00:40:45.440
"Too late for YouTube...?"

00:40:45.440 --> 00:40:48.100
*T R I G G E R E D*

00:40:48.100 --> 00:40:50.100
Excuse you?!

00:40:50.680 --> 00:40:52.440
ExCUse yoU??!!

00:40:52.440 --> 00:40:56.820
You telling me people aren't slaving their life away, 24/7

00:40:56.820 --> 00:40:59.620
the INSTANT that they hit the Subscribe button...

00:40:59.620 --> 00:41:00.980
There is a debt!

00:41:00.980 --> 00:41:02.960
A blood, debt, to pay!

00:41:02.960 --> 00:41:04.880
When you hit that Subscribe button,

00:41:04.880 --> 00:41:08.480
that means you watch EVERY video... ALL DAY!

00:41:09.940 --> 00:41:11.340
*quietly threatening*
and you'd better not be tired about it.

00:41:11.340 --> 00:41:13.100
Lookin' good still, even late at night!

00:41:13.100 --> 00:41:14.820
I like it— "Nice plant."

00:41:14.820 --> 00:41:15.600
Alright, welp...

00:41:15.900 --> 00:41:16.780
Exciting.

00:41:16.780 --> 00:41:17.900
"I'm so tired."

00:41:17.900 --> 00:41:19.540
*tired Markimoo noises*

00:41:19.540 --> 00:41:20.600
"Sleep?" Sure.

00:41:20.600 --> 00:41:21.760
Time for bed~

00:41:21.760 --> 00:41:24.240
Hoop-dee doop-dee, off to dreamworld I go~

00:41:24.240 --> 00:41:25.060
*mouth sounds*

00:41:25.060 --> 00:41:25.600
Okay.

00:41:25.980 --> 00:41:28.100
Get me back to fighting those goddamn Terrorlings.

00:41:28.900 --> 00:41:30.580
I'm ready to get blood on my hands.

00:41:31.120 --> 00:41:34.200
I'm just a— every, night, I'm just a bloodthirsty monster.

00:41:34.960 --> 00:41:36.740
Maybe that's the twist end of this game.

00:41:36.740 --> 00:41:37.740
*teleportation noise*

00:41:37.740 --> 00:41:40.100
Maybe we're... the real monsters.

00:41:40.100 --> 00:41:41.140
"Wait, where am I?"

00:41:41.140 --> 00:41:44.240
"Welcome back! You did fantastically yesterday."

00:41:44.240 --> 00:41:45.780
"Wait... I remember everything now!"

00:41:45.780 --> 00:41:47.260
"How could I forget all that?"

00:41:47.260 --> 00:41:48.660
"That's normal. It's still a dream."

00:41:48.660 --> 00:41:49.900
"People hardly ever remember dreams,"

00:41:49.900 --> 00:41:51.660
"and even when they do, it's vague and fleeting."

00:41:51.960 --> 00:41:54.500
"I guess I have to apologize for not believing you last night."

00:41:54.500 --> 00:41:55.500
"Don't worry about it."

00:41:55.500 --> 00:41:57.280
I've only written it down so I can remember

00:41:57.280 --> 00:41:58.880
how much you screwed me over...

00:41:58.880 --> 00:42:00.360
but don't worry about it, don't worry about it.

00:42:00.820 --> 00:42:01.980
"This is super unreal for me."

00:42:02.540 --> 00:42:03.820
"But I'll take the chance I have"

00:42:03.820 --> 00:42:05.300
"to help as many people as possible."

00:42:05.600 --> 00:42:06.720
"That's the spirit!"

00:42:06.720 --> 00:42:09.080
That's literally the spirit, 'cause we're all... ghosts.

00:42:09.080 --> 00:42:09.760
*bell tolls*

00:42:09.760 --> 00:42:11.440
Uh oh, first bong.

00:42:11.440 --> 00:42:12.620
"Guess I'd better hurry, huh?"

00:42:12.620 --> 00:42:13.260
"Seems like it."

00:42:13.260 --> 00:42:14.800
"I'll be in the Training Centre if you need me."

00:42:14.800 --> 00:42:15.760
"Come talk to me after you're"

00:42:15.760 --> 00:42:17.020
"done with your preparations."

00:42:17.020 --> 00:42:18.060
"You'll need to update your class"

00:42:18.060 --> 00:42:18.960
"and get a better weapon."

00:42:19.340 --> 00:42:20.120
h-ohh kaaay

00:42:21.120 --> 00:42:23.360
See ya, I don't know where to get weapons—

00:42:23.360 --> 00:42:24.080
WADE?

00:42:24.280 --> 00:42:25.140
Wait a minute.

00:42:25.140 --> 00:42:26.200
WADE a minute!

00:42:26.200 --> 00:42:28.100
"Oh my gosh! Hi, Wade! What are you doing here?"

00:42:28.240 --> 00:42:29.840
"Uh, oh, hi!"

00:42:30.180 --> 00:42:33.800
"I'm here to help out Mark on his mission tonight."

00:42:34.080 --> 00:42:35.960
"Really? That's awesome! Are you here often?"

00:42:35.960 --> 00:42:40.000
"Depends. Sometimes I like a change of pace,"

00:42:40.000 --> 00:42:41.920
"and to hang out with Mark."

00:42:42.240 --> 00:42:43.920
"Uh, I mean— not Mark."

00:42:43.920 --> 00:42:46.060
"Puh, that guy's the worst."

00:42:46.580 --> 00:42:47.480
"I heard that!"

00:42:48.240 --> 00:42:50.400
Oh, I heard that, very slow talking—

00:42:50.400 --> 00:42:52.100
and also me making fun of you,

00:42:52.100 --> 00:42:53.340
in a game where you're appearing

00:42:53.340 --> 00:42:54.460
and you can't defend yourself

00:42:54.460 --> 00:42:56.360
because you're not here... actually...

00:42:56.360 --> 00:42:57.700
ahh-I heard that!

00:42:57.700 --> 00:42:59.000
You're on thin ice, mister!

00:42:59.180 --> 00:42:59.680
Alright.

00:42:59.680 --> 00:43:01.020
"Saving people is exhausting."

00:43:01.020 --> 00:43:02.360
True... that.

00:43:02.360 --> 00:43:03.300
"I feel sick."

00:43:03.300 --> 00:43:04.000
Okay...

00:43:04.740 --> 00:43:05.620
"Hey Jude!"

00:43:05.880 --> 00:43:06.680
"Hey guys!"

00:43:06.680 --> 00:43:08.000
"Jude, why did you just show up?"

00:43:08.000 --> 00:43:09.720
"Isn't it like, 5am where you are?"

00:43:09.720 --> 00:43:11.440
"Well, I just got sleep 'cause I was playing Until Dawn."

00:43:11.440 --> 00:43:12.020
*Badum tss~*
"Well, I just got sleep 'cause I was playing Until Dawn."

00:43:14.060 --> 00:43:14.680
Oh, I hate...

00:43:15.500 --> 00:43:16.060
that...

00:43:16.360 --> 00:43:17.560
"You don't even have that game."

00:43:17.560 --> 00:43:19.240
"And where are you getting your own sound effects?"

00:43:19.240 --> 00:43:20.180
"I have my sources~"

00:43:20.540 --> 00:43:21.460
"Where did you get those sunglasses!?"

00:43:21.460 --> 00:43:22.320
"How are you doing that!?"

00:43:22.320 --> 00:43:23.500
"Jude, this is why we're friends."

00:43:23.880 --> 00:43:26.120
Alright, sorry to intrude on your conversation.

00:43:26.380 --> 00:43:28.260
"Lani's in the File room, looking for my file."

00:43:28.260 --> 00:43:29.300
"You should check yours too!"

00:43:29.520 --> 00:43:30.120
Okay.

00:43:30.300 --> 00:43:32.080
"Earlier, I told Mark I'd arm wrestle him,"

00:43:32.080 --> 00:43:32.860
"but he probably—"

00:43:34.460 --> 00:43:35.080
Oh, that's mysterious.

00:43:35.080 --> 00:43:36.420
I can't read the rest of this sentence.

00:43:36.420 --> 00:43:37.000
Eh-it's so weird.

00:43:37.000 --> 00:43:38.460
I— I just can't— It's just... jumbled.

00:43:38.700 --> 00:43:39.760
I don't even understand it.

00:43:39.940 --> 00:43:40.660
That's so bizarre.

00:43:41.260 --> 00:43:42.760
Oh well, guess we'll never know...

00:43:42.760 --> 00:43:43.860
HMMMMM

00:43:44.340 --> 00:43:45.960
"Good evening, young lady!"

00:43:45.960 --> 00:43:48.020
"Would you care for a stabby object?"

00:43:48.240 --> 00:43:48.740
Um...

00:43:49.060 --> 00:43:49.980
"Sure, why not!" *chuckles*

00:43:49.980 --> 00:43:50.480
Okay!

00:43:50.640 --> 00:43:51.860
"The following tutorial can be skipped"

00:43:51.860 --> 00:43:52.840
"by holding down the Shift button."

00:43:53.100 --> 00:43:54.240
"Welcome back Nage..."

00:43:54.240 --> 00:43:54.860
"Mage!"

00:43:55.380 --> 00:43:56.080
"Before you continue,"

00:43:56.080 --> 00:43:57.920
"you need to choose your tier two subclass."

00:43:57.920 --> 00:43:59.120
"Mages can either choose..."

00:43:59.120 --> 00:44:00.780
"Arcane Mage, or Nature Mage."

00:44:01.020 --> 00:44:03.280
"Arcane Mages use powerful eh-arcane magic"

00:44:03.280 --> 00:44:04.200
"to fight their enemies."

00:44:04.200 --> 00:44:04.940
"Their attack is higher"

00:44:04.940 --> 00:44:06.400
"and can heal enemies [allies] in battle."

00:44:06.400 --> 00:44:07.380
"The only disadvantage is that"

00:44:07.380 --> 00:44:09.020
"they don't inflict many status effects."

00:44:09.500 --> 00:44:10.060
"Attack: medium..."

00:44:10.480 --> 00:44:11.780
Alright, "Nature Mages..."

00:44:12.180 --> 00:44:13.280
"...attacks are not as powerful,"

00:44:13.280 --> 00:44:15.800
"but they inflict status effects for strategic advantage."

00:44:16.320 --> 00:44:17.380
Oooo...

00:44:17.700 --> 00:44:18.740
I like that.

00:44:20.460 --> 00:44:22.060
Ahh-I like that a lot.

00:44:22.480 --> 00:44:23.600
Mmm

00:44:24.020 --> 00:44:25.780
I could just be straight up whammy-bammy,

00:44:25.780 --> 00:44:27.080
or I could be all strategery,

00:44:27.080 --> 00:44:29.320
and thinkle-thunkle about it real hard.

00:44:29.320 --> 00:44:31.160
I'ma be the thinkle-thunkley type.

00:44:31.740 --> 00:44:33.860
"TU-UUMP acquired an Arbor Staff"

00:44:33.860 --> 00:44:34.960
"and Nature Mage armor!"

00:44:35.360 --> 00:44:37.900
"Good luck! And be sure to come back around"

00:44:37.900 --> 00:44:38.780
"for an upgrade..."

00:44:39.160 --> 00:44:40.980
"the next time you're around!"

00:44:41.200 --> 00:44:42.120
Okay, thank you!

00:44:42.120 --> 00:44:42.800
Uh oh...

00:44:42.800 --> 00:44:43.960
Hello, hi?

00:44:44.520 --> 00:44:45.960
"Hey, there you are!"

00:44:45.960 --> 00:44:46.680
"W-what?"

00:44:47.000 --> 00:44:47.860
"This is really real?"

00:44:48.200 --> 00:44:50.620
"Yeah, it's crazy, I know. I'm... still in shock myself."

00:44:50.620 --> 00:44:52.640
Can't you see... by my shocked expression?

00:44:52.640 --> 00:44:54.500
"But, now you'll be helping save people,"

00:44:54.500 --> 00:44:55.760
"just like I helped you!"

00:44:55.760 --> 00:44:57.040
You're permanently enslaved

00:44:57.040 --> 00:44:59.020
to this dream world of helping people...

00:44:59.020 --> 00:44:59.900
No matter what!

00:44:59.900 --> 00:45:01.660
You won't have a normal dream ever again!

00:45:01.660 --> 00:45:02.800
Ha ha ha ha~

00:45:03.080 --> 00:45:04.980
"Me? I can't... I couldn't!"

00:45:04.980 --> 00:45:06.400
"I don't want to... hold you back."

00:45:06.640 --> 00:45:08.220
"Nonsense! We'll be an awesome team!"

00:45:08.220 --> 00:45:09.160
I've decided this.

00:45:09.460 --> 00:45:10.160
"You think so?"

00:45:10.700 --> 00:45:11.840
I know so, Blermf...

00:45:12.400 --> 00:45:13.180
I know so.

00:45:13.400 --> 00:45:15.120
"First off, you should pick your class."

00:45:15.120 --> 00:45:17.280
"I'm gonna go stock up on items and all that stuff."

00:45:17.280 --> 00:45:19.380
"Will do. I'll wait for you here."

00:45:19.940 --> 00:45:20.760
Okay, alright.

00:45:21.120 --> 00:45:21.800
"I'm a soldier—"

00:45:21.800 --> 00:45:22.620
Okay, never mind.

00:45:22.620 --> 00:45:23.720
You're saying the same thing, aren't you?

00:45:24.500 --> 00:45:25.460
"Last mission went well!"

00:45:25.700 --> 00:45:26.360
Alright.

00:45:26.560 --> 00:45:28.020
D-oh 'kay, uh-right!

00:45:28.520 --> 00:45:29.500
*gibberish*

00:45:29.500 --> 00:45:30.140
Okay!

00:45:31.240 --> 00:45:32.480
Alright, you two still fighting?

00:45:32.480 --> 00:45:33.120
Same people?

00:45:33.120 --> 00:45:34.140
"No, you swing first!"

00:45:34.780 --> 00:45:35.560
Uh, okay

00:45:35.980 --> 00:45:36.760
"You swing first!"

00:45:36.760 --> 00:45:37.360
Okay

